   "body": "Community evidence (HFR+ topic, community, 2026-10-28; beta topic p. 1 #7, #19–#24): members ask for a `Tous · Favoris · Suivis · Lus` filter at the top of the Favoris tab **across all categories** (like the site's \"Vos sujets\"), and did not know the existing \"Drapeaux & Favoris\" / \"Favoris uniquement\" setting; the tab name \"Favoris\" confused some (it shows followed topics; ★ favourite, blue flag followed, red flag read). The legacy Favoris tab already has the segmented `Tous · Favoris · Suivis · Lus` (`HFRswift/Swift/MainWindow.swift:660-678`).\n\nAcceptance criteria added here:\n- [ ] The Favoris tab offers the legacy `Tous · Favoris · Suivis · Lus` filter; the spec decides, with the legacy source, whether it applies across all categories or per category, and records the community request.\n- [ ] The favourites-mode setting is reachable from the Favoris screen itself (not only in Réglages).",
